id: pm-csv-5s5i
title: Focus-inheritance test must opt into explicit SDK focus inheritance
description: ""
type: Issue
status: open
priority: 2
tags[4]: dependencies,migration,sdk,toolchain
created_at: "2026-11-03T07:53:04.838Z"
updated_at: "2026-11-03T12:12:36.016Z"
author: pi-fleet-sdk-sentinel-1103
comments[2]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-11-03T07:53:09.845Z",pi-fleet-sdk-sentinel-1103,"The reviewed-empty-parents replay test seeds an item with a plain SDK create (no explicit parent) and asserts it inherited the active focus parent, so the following join replay must refuse. The pinned toolchain made SDK focus inheritance opt-in (inheritFocus; CLI default on, SDK default off), so the plain create no longer inherits and the refusal premise breaks. Expected fix: pass inheritFocus on that seed create (mirroring the toolchain's own new contract) and re-verify the refusal path. This failure is not the sentinel change and is out of the sentinel migration's scope here."
  "2026-11-03T12:12:27.723Z",pi-toolchain-glm-1103,"Fixed and verified on the current Dependabot head: the reviewed-empty-parents seed create now passes inheritFocus: true, mirroring the pinned toolchain contract (pm-cli 2026.10.26 GH-1577 made SDK focus inheritance opt-in). test/mutation-intent.test.ts passes in full, including 'focus changes do not alter reviewed empty parents; previously inherited scope refuses replay'."
tests[1]{command,scope,provenance{author,created_at,source_kind,source_ref}}:
  node --test test/mutation-intent.test.ts,project,pi-toolchain-glm-1103,"2026-11-03T12:12:35.882Z",local_mutation,dependabot/npm_and_yarn/pm-toolchain-83955e8a70
body: ""
